From c127161ce6b8325a0701bfb4563876995bd48b46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 14:18:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/17] invariant: a snapshot is immutable and hashed, and a
 cycle invents nothing

build_snapshot freezes a panel and hashes its bytes; the cycle refuses a
snapshot that no longer matches its manifest. With no engine, run_experiment
raises and the hypothesis is recorded blocked:no_engine rather than killed by a
veto it was never measured against. make check runs lint, tests and the holdout
lock explicitly.
